== Description ==

'''Graphite Ore''' is a mineable ore in ''[[Human Host]]'', obtained by [[Mining|mining]] terrain deposits. It appears as an ingredient in 37 downstream recipes at the [[Anvil]] and the [[Cutting Workbench]], including [[Titanium Alloy]], [[Cast Iron]], [[Gear]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

